Error [jet.FunctionValueLabelMismatch]: This needs fn(*, force: Bool) -> Int, but the function value is fn(Bool) -> Int
  --> tests/ui/language_features/nested_callable_containers_keep_required_public_labels.jet:4:59
    |
  4 |     handlers: [String:fn(*, force: Bool) -> Int]{"plain": plain}
    |                                                           ^^^^^
 Why: Public labels and parameter zones are part of a function's callable type
 Fix: Use `fn(*, force: Bool) -> Int` here
